// BackupInfo Detailed status of a runtime backup. The aggregated state is computed from the backup state of each partition as: - If the backup of all partitions is 'COMPLETED', the overall state is 'COMPLETED'. - If one partition is 'FAILED', the overall state is 'FAILED'. - Otherwise, if one partition is 'DOES_NOT_EXIST', the overall state is 'INCOMPLETE'. - Otherwise, if one partition is 'IN_PROGRESS', the overall state is 'IN_PROGRESS'.
